{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39758","headline":"塞上 · 黄滔","name":"塞上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掘地破重城，烧山搜伏兵。\n金徽互呜咽，玉笛自凄清。\n使发西都耸，尘空北岳横。\n长河涉有路，旷野宿无程。\n沙雨黄莺啭，辕门青草生。\n马归秦苑牧，人在虏云耕。\n落日牛羊聚，秋风鼓角鸣。\n如何汉天子，青塚杳含情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}